  hero={{
    label: "Serving Sheffield, Alabama Since 1993",
    heading: "Sheffield's Trusted Cleaning & Restoration Partner",
    subheading: "Sheffield is home — part of the Quad Cities community BamaClean has served since 1993. From the neighborhoods near Helen Keller Hospital to the residential areas off Montgomery Avenue — we know Sheffield, and we're 15 minutes away.",
  }}
  intro={`
    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Sheffield is one of the Quad Cities — the four Tennessee River communities of Florence, Sheffield, Tuscumbia, and Muscle Shoals that form the Shoals' urban core. BamaClean is headquartered in Florence, which puts us 15–25 minutes from Sheffield at virtually any time of day. We've cleaned carpets, restored flood-damaged homes, and inspected crawlspaces in Sheffield neighborhoods since our founding — and we know the city's residential character as well as we know any market we serve.</p>
    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Sheffield's housing stock has a distinctive character: a high proportion of mid-century brick homes on established lots, neighborhoods that were developed during the postwar manufacturing boom when Reynolds Metals and other Shoals industrial employers were at their peak workforce, and a community culture that values durability, practicality, and honest dealing. Those are values we share. Sheffield customers who've been using BamaClean for 20 years aren't using us because we have the best marketing — they're using us because we deliver what we quote and we show up when we say we will.</p>
