      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Sheffield residents have been comparing local and national cleaning options long enough to know the difference. National franchise brands reach Sheffield from both Florence and Huntsville — the response times are longer, the local knowledge is absent, and the pricing includes the franchise overhead that local companies don't carry. BamaClean's Florence headquarters means we're 15–25 minutes from Sheffield — faster than any Huntsville-dispatched crew can claim.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">The pricing difference matters to Sheffield homeowners. A national franchise quote for a 3-bedroom home arrives on the phone at one number and appears on the invoice at another — protection packages, deodorizers, and per-stain charges are built into the revenue model. BamaClean quotes by square footage before we start and that's the number on your invoice.</p>
      <p>Most of our Sheffield customers came to us from a national franchise. Almost none of them have gone back.</p>
